    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Counts follow the thing they multiply, so reading backwards lets you know each multiplier before you meet the atoms it scales.",
      "You need only totals, not the structure of the formula.",
      "Nesting depth can be large and you want to avoid recursion limits."
    ]
  },
