        "value": "Use an index i starting at the last character. A digit run is found by walking left while the previous character is a digit; a name by walking left while the character is lowercase, then including the uppercase letter. ')' pushes multipliers[-1]*pending, '(' pops, and each name adds pending*multipliers[-1] to its total. Both candidates then sort the names and print counts above 1."
      },
